# doctui core rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` before making changes.
- Build Vue-first APIs; do not imitate React mechanics when Vue has a native pattern.
- Do not introduce Reka UI or another component framework.
- Reuse internal primitives/composables instead of duplicating focus, overlay, dismissal or positioning logic.
- Treat accessibility and public API compatibility as correctness requirements.
- Do not switch package managers, formatters, test frameworks or build systems without an explicit task requiring it.
- Keep runtime dependencies small and justified.
- Mantine is a reference for ideas and behavior, not a mandate to copy its implementation.
